| nelb-r02c-002 | spinning-rotor remaining vacuum of an MBE chamber (k_s·(τ0/τ−1) Pa, Spinveil last-good denial, 24 min N2-purge floor) | Larkspire MBE LS-7 chamber C-4 (invented, HIL dummy in SRG-HIL-8): 24.00/8.00 reconstructs 4.00 Pa while Spinveil still reads 0.80 Pa | MODIFY (+0.40) / ACCEPT (+0.35) | serialized `2.00*(24.00/8.00-1)=4.00` and `24.00/8.00-1=2.00`; keep-pumping refused; rotor tech Mira Quill exonerated (missing rotor-zero AE, UTC vs UTC+2); companion t2 new-rotor restart; sim_or_real=hil |
